<title>USA: Streamlogic may file bankruptcy, sees loss.</title>
<headline>Streamlogic may file bankruptcy, sees loss.</headline>
<dateline>MENLO PARK, Calif. 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>StreamLogic Corp said Tuesday it may file for bankruptcy and faces likely delisting from Nasdaq following a series of events including large fourth quarter and fiscal year losses and failure to make a scheduled payment on debt.</p>
<p>The company said preliminary results for the fourth quarter and fiscal 1997 ended March 28 show losses of $20.8 million and $16.1 million, respectively. The fiscal year loss included an extraordinary gain of $24.1 million in the third quarter, the company said.</p>
</text>
